{"id":"n20911-4-10","stage":0,"title":"마음 · 心意","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n20911-4-10-1","ko":"어제 민준이가 나한테 같이 영화 보자고 했어.","zh":"昨天敏俊约我一起去看电影。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"민준이가","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"민준이가","audio":"/audio/2d578794e58a65e57305.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"나한테","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같이","meaning":"一同，一块儿，共同","explanation":"같이：一同，一块儿，共同","readings":[{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26799","senseId":"2","lemma":"같이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"영화","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보자고","meaning":"表示有意去做前面的话语所指的行动。","explanation":"보다：表示有意去做前面的话语所指的行动。；자고：转述一起行动的提议：“提议、说一起……”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했어.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"d44da011993f2a6e","term":"같이","zh":"一同，一块儿，共同","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3","entryId":"26799","definition":"和某物或某人一起。","pronunciation":["가치"]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"表示有意去做前面的话语所指的行动。","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"表示有意去做前面的话语所指的行动。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/09a996edaac9c3af9b78.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n20911-4-10-2","ko":"그래? 민준이가 너한테 마음이 있나 보다.","zh":"是吗？看来敏俊对你有意思啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"그래：真的","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"2","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"민준이가","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"민준이가","audio":"/audio/2d578794e58a65e57305.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"너한테","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마음이","meaning":"心意，心思","explanation":"마음：心意，心思；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"마음","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20911","senseId":"4","lemma":"마음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있나","meaning":"可能","explanation":"있다：可能；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"6","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보다.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于对对方所说的话表示感叹或轻微的惊讶。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"aa9cbf25b5381e2c","term":"마음","zh":"心意，心思","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3","entryId":"20911","definition":"喜爱或关心的心情。","pronunciation":["마음"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"可能","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"存在发生某种状况的可能性或实为如此。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fe130383661b224643c6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.18,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=20911","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"초급","day":27,"sequenceScore":1.3297,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是吗？看来敏俊对你有意思啊。","昨天敏俊约我一起去看电影。","妈妈，我觉得这件衣服您穿会更合适呢。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["昨天敏俊约我一起去看电影。","妈妈，我觉得这件衣服您穿会更合适呢。","是吗？看来敏俊对你有意思啊。"],"answer":2}]}
